<!-- Bank instrument detail for tally_get_bank_reconciliation.

     Shape copied from day-book.xml, whose BANKALLOCATIONS.LIST came from a real
     export; all values here are invented. Four vouchers, chosen to cover every
     branch the tool has:

       P-20  cheque WITH a BANKERSDATE      -> reconciled
       P-21  cheque with BANKERSDATE empty  -> unreconciled (element dropped by
                                               the parser, which is exactly how
                                               Tally represents "not done")
       R-9   e-fund receipt, no bank date   -> unreconciled, and the sign is
                                               opposite to a payment
       J-3   journal, no bank allocation    -> contributes no row at all

     Because at least one voucher carries a bank date, the tool can treat the
     absence of one on the others as meaningful. The all-absent case is covered
     separately using day-book.xml. -->
